Vov
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 4 ROTATE 3 U 3
COLUMN 1 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 1 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL

VAEROV 4 FACE_LAST
VAEROV 4 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
    AND
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, SPADES, CLUBS, HEARTS}
        DEST Size <= 4
MOVE_STACK COLUMN COLUMN
OR
    SRCSTACK Rank add_13
    AND
        SRCSTACK Size > 6
        DEST Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS, SPADES}
MOVE_STACK COLUMN VAEROV
DESTSRC Rank equal
$win
PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
